{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awaken Infinity</strong> is a visual novel with top-down 2D segments. You wake up with no memory in a locked, futuristic room, and the only one you can talk to is an artificial intelligence. Will you uncover the truth?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168400/extras/5bbfd6a8aabaf3ad264f16a274ae4206.poster.avif?t=1759478080\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168400/extras/5bbfd6a8aabaf3ad264f16a274ae4206.webm?t=1759478080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168400/extras/5bbfd6a8aabaf3ad264f16a274ae4206.mp4?t=1759478080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is it?</strong><br>Awaken Infinity is a compact, story-driven experience that blends visual novel storytelling with a touch of top-down 2D exploration. It\u2019s designed to be completed in a single sitting\u2014focused and without filler. Illustrated scenes and dialogue drive the narrative, while short top-down 2D segments enhance the story without overshadowing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168400/extras/7dd1f7e3628ce98f4197a644f88cec20.poster.avif?t=1759478080\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168400/extras/7dd1f7e3628ce98f4197a644f88cec20.webm?t=1759478080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168400/extras/7dd1f7e3628ce98f4197a644f88cec20.mp4?t=1759478080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you\u2019ll do</strong><br>\u2022 Wake up with no memory and try to make sense of your situation in a sterile, futuristic environment.<br>\u2022 Make choices that influence dialogue, unlock optional lines, and reveal short extra scenes.<br>\u2022 Explore in short top-down 2D segments to examine objects, trigger events, and uncover clues that deepen the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Echo of Awakening","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3168400/25ae52ea5ea4df042b3bb6738cf7ea7db98d098d.jpg"},{"name":"Fragments of the Past","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3168400/121773a1ce49d50d1de4271677349a745f28b4a1.jpg"},{"name":"Synthetic Pulse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3168400/bdec3882c1f4653ab26b19e8ca1b79bf4d191aa7.jpg"},{"name":"Loop Divergence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3168400/c1a8fc5c49f06dd245036f29b6a7e4e23e74a512.jpg"},{"name":"Neural Horizon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3168400/94ee68b8a5a35f338702882ae66fff026a831300.jpg"},{"name":"Infinite Rebirth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3168400/4ee126b26b991f0ab180b88327473ea652f0f21e.jpg"},{"name":"Easter Egg Room","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3168400/5753365a05be68a425bbfd126590cf95d94a873b.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3168400?t=1759478080","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3168400?t=1759478080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168400/49e3048cc6fcc202529445cecd01c0d24cf62b5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759478080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it